{
    "metadata": {
        "title": "Aquasana F-300R 300,000 Gallon Whole House Water Filtration System 20-Inch Sediment Pre-Filter Replacement",
        "last_updated": "December 27, 2022",
        "estimated_time": "15 - 20 minutes",
        "difficulty": "Easy",
        "featured_student_guide": true,
        "introduction": "Use this guide to replace the 20-inch sediment pre-filter for your Aquasana F-300R 300,000-gallon whole house water filtration system.\nThe sediment pre-filter keeps rust, dirt, and sediment particles from entering the main filter unit.\nAfter 2-3 months of use (when the pre-filter darkens or water flow slows), the sediment pre-filter must be replaced. When this pre-filter is not replaced in a timely manner, water pressure can drop, and sediment particles can enter and clog the main filter tank."
    },
